<title>USA: Integrity Inc Q4 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Integrity Inc Q4 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>MOBILE, Ala. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended	     Year Ended</p>
<p>			  December 31		December 31</p>
<p>		    1996	    1995	  1996	    1995</p>
<p>Net revenue</p>
<p>	     $6,519,000    $7,649,000 $30,395,000   $36,277,000</p>
<p>Loss on impairment of long-lived assets</p>
<p>		1,200,000		--   1,200,000		--</p>
<p>Provision for (benefit from)  </p>
<p>income taxes</p>
<p>		(493,000)     (817,000)   (654,000)   (1,183,000)</p>
<p>Income (loss) before extraordinary   item    (3,399,000)   (1,366,000) (3,459,000)   (2,052,000)</p>
<p>Extraordinary item from early extinguishment   of debt	    --		--   (248,000)		--</p>
<p>Net income (loss)</p>
<p>	    (3,399,000)   (1,366,000) (3,707,000)   (2,052,000)</p>
<p>Earnings per share Income (loss) before extraordinary item</p>
<p>			 --		--	(0.63)		--</p>
<p>Net income (loss)   per share    (0.62)	  (0.25)	(0.67)	  (0.37)</p>
<p>Weighted average number of shares outstanding</p>
<p>		5,514,000     5,514,000   5,514,000     5,514,000</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net income for the fourth quarter of 1996 included a pre-tax write-down of a building project and record masters of $2.9 million, or $0.53 per share.</p>
<p>The extraordinary charge in fiscal 1996 of $248,000 was related to early extinguishment of debt as part of a refinancing.</p>
